-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Vincentelli</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rabut</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Stewart</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Way</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A complex of N-WASP and WIP integrates signalling cascades that lead to actin polymerization</article-title><source>Nature Cell Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>441</fpage><lpage>448</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10878810</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moss</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Knipe</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Howley</surname><given-names>PM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Poxviridae: the viruses and their replication</article-title><source>Fields Virology</source><year>2007</year><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Lippincott Williams and Wilkins</publisher-name><fpage>2905</fpage><lpage>2945</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Newsome</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name><name><surname>Scaplehorn</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Way</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>SRC mediates a switch from microtubule- to actin-based motility of vaccinia virus</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2004</year><volume>306</volume><fpage>124</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15297625</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Newsome</surname><given-names>TP</given-names></name><name><surname>Weisswange</surnam